{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What kind of game is <strong>City God Alice</strong>?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>City God Alice</i> is a 2D side-scrolling RPG that blends:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark Eastern-style exploration &amp; puzzle-solving</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn-based combat with horizontal positioning &amp; psychological interference</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Temple management, random events, and character-bond strategy systems</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you enjoy story, atmosphere, combat, or strategy,<br><strong>City God Alice offers a unique supernatural experience.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045810/extras/972680cb4f2337260faf3c271f1f17f4.avif?t=1770190694\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story takes place in the ancient mountain temple city <strong>Jiantan Mountain City</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a child, <strong>Lin Chengdong</strong> signed a mysterious spiritual contract with the City God.<br>The contract erased his memory of the deal and sealed his fate\u2014<br>he will <strong>die at age 21</strong> and serve as a spiritual officer afterward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Years later, with his final year approaching, an unexpected visitor appears:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alice \u2014 the acting City God.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She offers him cooperation, but her request is shocking:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>She wants Lin Chengdong to give up his remaining year of life and take office immediately.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As mysteries, vengeful spirits, and century-old grudges intertwine,<br><strong>your choices will determine his fate \u2014 and the fate of the entire mountain city.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045810/extras/20ca5058dcf84ba8845a97234ae0267e.avif?t=1770190694\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045810/extras_big/20ca5058dcf84ba8845a97234ae0267e.webp?t=1770190694 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045810/extras/7ecbfc8dfcb7e4fdcbb50f1a437dbb41.avif?t=1770190694\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This is the inner world of someone you care about \u2014 and your dungeon</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inside <strong>the Yuan-Chen Palace</strong>, a hallucination-ridden mental landscape:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies born from resentment &amp; inner demons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obstacles formed from obsession</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clues shaped by precious memories</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A world both real and unreal \u2014 dangerous and beautiful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045810/extras/c3de0099084157186338c8b53d842fdd.avif?t=1770190694\" width=1560 height=876 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045810/extras/1998bda4fb70a346f69ed67a490b3923.avif?t=1770190694\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Turn-Based Combat \u00d7 Horizontal Positioning \u00d7 SAN (Sanity) System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat blends strategy and psychological tension:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Positioning lets you dodge lethal supernatural attacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spirit-descending buffs &amp; ally cover help you survive</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The lower your SAN, the more unstable your abilities become</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breakdown may even cause self-inflicted backlash</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mind and tactics are equally important.<br><strong>Only the sane survive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045810/extras/33c170e8e3bdfde5b56a916d5eab9dbb.avif?t=1770190694\" width=1538 height=806 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045810/extras/ccdfc78b1a081eb8e9b1e98a278a8ce4.avif?t=1770190694\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Temple Life: Management \u00d7 Bonds \u00d7 Events</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between battles, return to your City God Temple:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Handle daily affairs &amp; stroll events \u2192 Gain reputation</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bond with yokai officers \u2192 Unlock exclusive chapters</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade facilities, build puppets &amp; allocate resources</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch how the \u201ctemple keeper\u201d turns the supernatural into daily routine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045810/extras/ef691bba9b768e70c36e5734d41eac52.avif?t=1770190694\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you come for the story, the atmosphere, the combat, or the strategy,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CityGod Alice offers a supernatural RPG experience unlike any other.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>We sincerely invite you to join us.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exploration:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move (2D plane) = W/S/A/D</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move (side-scroll) = A/D</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inventory = B</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip / drag items to shortcut bar = Mouse left-drag</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exit text = ESC</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interact with objects</strong> = Space</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Continue dialogue / Continue tutorial</strong> = Space</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use quick items</strong> = Number keys 1\u20136</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Battle / Temple:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All actions via mouse</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick items = 1~6</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SHIFT + click = Select resource in bulk</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TAB = Switch resource details</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4045810?t=1770190694","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045810/7527ed174e67ac95719184794724a1c2652c3f07/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770190694","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045810/a31298583269f8e943b5385c7fa83da2278791e1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770190694","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045810/a31298583269f8e943b5385c7fa83da2278791e1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770190694","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What kind of game is <strong>City God Alice</strong>?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>City God Alice</i> is a 2D side-scrolling RPG that blends:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark Eastern-style exploration &amp; puzzle-solving</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn-based combat with horizontal positioning &amp; psychological interference</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Temple management, random events, and character-bond strategy systems</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you enjoy story, atmosphere, combat, or strategy,<br><strong>City God Alice offers a unique supernatural experience.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045810/extras/972680cb4f2337260faf3c271f1f17f4.avif?t=1770190694\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story takes place in the ancient mountain temple city <strong>Jiantan Mountain City</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a child, <strong>Lin Chengdong</strong> signed a mysterious spiritual contract with the City God.<br>The contract erased his memory of the deal and sealed his fate\u2014<br>he will <strong>die at age 21</strong> and serve as a spiritual officer afterward.</p><p class