mple:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Handle daily affairs &amp; stroll events \u2192 Gain reputation</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bond with yokai officers \u2192 Unlock exclusive chapters</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade facilities, build puppets &amp; allocate resources</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch how the \u201ctemple keeper\u201d turns the supernatural into daily routine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045810/extras/ef691bba9b768e70c36e5734d41eac52.avif?t=1770190694\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you come for the story, the atmosphere, the combat, or the strategy,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CityGod Alice offers a supernatural RPG experience unlike any other.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>We sincerely invite you to join us.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exploration:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move (2D plane) = W/S/A/D</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move (side-scroll) = A/D</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inventory = B</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip / drag items to shortcut bar = Mouse left-drag</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exit text = ESC</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interact with objects</strong> = Space</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Continue dialogue / Continue tutorial</strong> = Space</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use quick items</strong> = Number keys 1\u20136</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Battle / Temple:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All actions via mouse</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick items = 1~6</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SHIFT + click = Select resource in bulk</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TAB = Switch resource details</p></li></ul>","developers":["HIGHFIVE DOG"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045810/87a534e4d8abc8eddbb8aaad421425e05a0e1bf5/header.jpg?t=1770190694","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4045810/1421025146/f2fc82aff65c21ee20dad532a6fb8b910b0d24c8/1765763078/dash_av1.mpd?t=1765767766","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4045810/1421025146/f2fc82aff65c21ee20dad532a6fb8b910b0d24c8/1765763078/dash_h264.mpd?t=1765767766","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4045810/1421025146/f2fc82aff65c21ee20dad532a6fb8b910b0d24c8/1765763078/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1765767766","id":257209067,"name":"City God Alice\uff1a\u57ce\u968d\u611b\u9e97\u7d72-English","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257209067/68e70822b72551d510340b2ba0df5dc96684cdb8/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1765767766"}],"name":"City God Alice\uff1a\u57ce\u968d\u611b\u9e97\u7d72","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-2100 / AMD FX-4300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 650 / AMD R7 250X<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> 1080p, 16:9 recommended</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong>